{"id":"n30446-1-7","stage":4,"title":"겸허 · 谦虚","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30446-1-7-1","ko":"그 친구는 잘난 척이 너무 심해.","zh":"那个朋友太爱卖弄了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"친구는","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구는","audio":"/audio/3cc026d51b6dcef53c27.mp3"}},{"text":"잘난","meaning":"出色，突出，了不起","explanation":"잘나다：出色，突出，了不起；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘나다","audio":"/audio/40b1ced772e2098c3924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24897","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘난","audio":"/audio/04b91d59e7b37b993b09.mp3"}},{"text":"척이","meaning":"装，装作，假装，佯装","explanation":"척：装，装作，假装，佯装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"척","audio":"/audio/59489b45305651d03f23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72054","senseId":"1","lemma":"척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"척이","audio":"/audio/f2d02f5388456f34fb4a.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"심해.","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"